    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_powerup_03",
      "hash64": "C0F283FB90679419",
      "text": "Phew... The upgrade’s all done!\\c\\nYou shouldn’t need as much BP or materials\\nfor print jobs now!\\c\\nWe also added a new [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]2× Item Bonus[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] function!\\nYou might sometimes get double the items!\\c\\nOh, also, it doesn’t help the Item Printer work\\nany better, but I made it look like a Great Ball!\\r\\nNow that that’s done...",
