      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_powerup_04",
      "hash64": "C0F284FB906795CC",
      "text": "Phew... The Item Printer’s second upgrade is\\nall done!\\c\\nYou should need even less BP and fewer\\nmaterials for print jobs now!\\c\\nAnd the new [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Poké Ball Lotto [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]function could give\\nyou a shot at printing rare Poké Balls!\\c\\nOh, also, it doesn’t help the Item Printer work\\nany better, but I made it look like an Ultra Ball!\\r\\nNow that that’s done...",
