      "hash64": "C0F285FB9067977F",
      "text": "Phew... The Item Printer’s final upgrade is\\nall done!\\c\\nThe Item Printer can now print multiples of the\\nsame item!\\c\\nAnd it can print Stellar Tera Shards now!\\c\\nOh, also, it doesn’t help the Item Printer work\\nany better, but I made it look like a Master Ball!\\c\\nI really appreciate you taking part in our\\nresearch! Now that that’s done...",
